  "prefLabel": "Per 103.02 Requests for Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 103.02 Requests for Information. State employees, appointing authorities, and members of the public may request services and information from the division at the address below on weekdays between the hours of 8:00 a.m. and 4:00 p.m.:\n\nDivision of Personnel\n\n54 Regional Drive, #5\n\nConcord, NH 03301-8502\n\nTel: 603-271-3261\n\nTDD Access: Relay NH 1-800-735-2964\n\nFax: 603-271-1422\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; ss by #10801, eff 5-17-15; ss by #14441, eff 12-1-25",
